  "No sources yet. Until you add one, the app plays what you already have — anything in Downloads, and any magnet or torrent file you open yourself.": "Nog geen bronne nie. Totdat jy een byvoeg, speel die program wat jy reeds het — enigiets in Aflaaie, en enige magneet of torrentlêer wat jy self oopmaak.",
  "No storage settings on this device. Format the drive as FAT32 on a computer — every Android box accepts it.": "Geen bergingsinstellings op hierdie toestel nie. Formateer die skyf as FAT32 op 'n rekenaar — elke Android-boks aanvaar dit.",
  "No subtitles found.": "Geen onderskrifte gevind nie.",
  "No title or IMDb id for this stream, so nothing to search by.": "Geen titel of IMDb-ID vir hierdie stroom nie, so daar is niks om mee te soek nie.",
  "No torrents match this filter.": "Geen torrents pas by hierdie filter nie.",
  "None": "Geen",
  "Normal": "Normaal",
  "Normal speed": "Normale spoed",
  "Not now": "Nie nou nie",
  "Not supported yet": "Nog nie ondersteun nie",
  "Nothing answered. Check the other device has casting switched on, or type its address below.": "Niks het geantwoord nie. Kyk of die ander toestel uitsaai aangeskakel het, of tik sy adres hieronder.",
  "Nothing certain in the last twenty minutes — listening to the whole film…": "Niks seker in die laaste twintig minute nie — luister na die hele film…",
  "Nothing chosen yet, so the background is a flat colour for now.": "Nog niks gekies nie, so die agtergrond is vir eers 'n plat kleur.",
  "Nothing downloading.": "Niks laai af nie.",
  "Nothing here.": "Niks hier nie.",
  "Nothing matches.": "Niks pas nie.",
  "Nothing on this device can open that file. HEVC/x265 and AV1 depend on the hardware decoder, and older boxes have neither — try a 1080p x264 release.": "Niks op hierdie toestel kan daardie lêer oopmaak nie. HEVC/x265 en AV1 hang van die hardewaredekodeerder af, en ouer bokse het nie een nie — probeer 'n 1080p x264-vrystelling.",
  "Nothing to play": "Niks om te speel nie",
  "Off": "Af",
  "Off, your own background is left out of it: the theme keeps its own colours while the picture is up, and only moves when a title's artwork covers it.": "Af word jou eie agtergrond daarbuite gelaat: die tema hou sy eie kleure terwyl die prent op is, en beweeg net wanneer 'n titel se kunswerk dit bedek.",
  "On the air": "Op die lug",
  "On, the background follows whichever card you're pointing at or have selected. Off, it only changes when you actually open something — steadier on a long list, where sweeping across a row otherwise repaints the whole window card by card.": "Aan volg die agtergrond die kaart waarna jy wys of wat gekies is. Af verander dit net wanneer jy werklik iets oopmaak — stabieler op 'n lang lys, waar 'n veeg oor 'n ry andersins die hele venster kaart vir kaart oorverf.",
  "On, your picture is what the app rests on and the artwork covers it while you're on a film or show. Off, the picture stays put and nothing ever covers it.": "Aan is jou prent waarop die program rus, en die kunswerk bedek dit terwyl jy by 'n film of reeks is. Af bly die prent staan en niks bedek dit ooit nie.",
  "One colour, and Material's own generator works out the rest of the palette from it.": "Een kleur, en Material se eie genereerder werk die res van die palet daaruit uit.",
  "One earlier episode in this season is still unwatched.": "Een vroeëre episode in hierdie seisoen is nog ongekyk.",
  "One earlier season is still unwatched.": "Een vroeëre seisoen is nog ongekyk.",
  "One-off or monthly, from any card or PayPal. Ko-fi takes no cut of it.": "Eenmalig of maandeliks, met enige kaart of PayPal. Ko-fi vat niks daarvan nie.",
  "Only download on Wi-Fi": "Laai net op Wi-Fi af",
  "Only downloaded subtitles can be synced; the file's own tracks already match it.": "Net afgelaaide onderskrifte kan gesinkroniseer word; die lêer se eie bane pas reeds daarby.",
  "Only needed if the app stops loading artwork and titles. Create one free under your TMDB account settings, API, “API Read Access Token”. It is kept out of backup files.": "Net nodig as die program ophou om kunswerk en titels te laai. Skep gratis een onder jou TMDB-rekeninginstellings, API, “API Read Access Token”. Dit word uit rugsteunlêers gehou.",
